|               |             HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(l_orderkey@0, o_orderkey@0)], projection=[l_shipmode@1, o_orderpriority@3]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
